{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ink Link is a sleek world of action in 2.5D! Outsmart enemies, piece together platforms, and upgrade your skills to take on powerful bosses. Discover hidden paths as darkness creeps in and your ally-turned-enemy, Ink, tests your skills\u2014and your will to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ink, who guides you through your journey, both as an ally... and a nemesis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 main areas with a boss at the end of each one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area consists of multiple levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level consists of a number of platforms that the player needs to assemble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, enemies hinder the player's quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game advances, a fog of war develops, making navigating the level more difficult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multitude of skills to buy and upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many weapons to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole lot of fun</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As darkness creeps in, make your way through the battlefield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ink, your not-so-faithful guide, might plunge you in darkness if you are not careful and step too close. Be sure to fight off the enemies while staying away from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/061598d098843bf067df340509724b86.poster.avif?t=1770381499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/061598d098843bf067df340509724b86.webm?t=1770381499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/061598d098843bf067df340509724b86.mp4?t=1770381499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relentlessly assemble platforms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together scattered platforms to complete the level and progress. Each step in your assembly brings you closer to your goal, testing your wit and spatial awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/2637cd565a4a6714127906b67f59c56d.poster.avif?t=1770381499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/2637cd565a4a6714127906b67f59c56d.webm?t=1770381499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/2637cd565a4a6714127906b67f59c56d.mp4?t=1770381499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test your skills against powerful bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through enemy-filled levels as you dodge, shoot, and outsmart foes that block your path. At the end of each area, face off against unique bosses, each with distinct abilities and weaknesses. These encounters push your skills to the limit as you find ways to counter their relentless attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/8f2a0974bcb9d2159c8ef334589f6521.poster.avif?t=1770381499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/8f2a0974bcb9d2159c8ef334589f6521.webm?t=1770381499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/8f2a0974bcb9d2159c8ef334589f6521.mp4?t=1770381499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose from a variety of skills and weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful new abilities and weapons and boost your stats with the XP you earn. Customize your playstyle by enhancing health, attack power, and more, ensuring you\u2019re ready for whatever the next level throws at you. Choose from a variety of weapons depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/704419bc6743c403988c7dffd4870a46.poster.avif?t=1770381499\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/704419bc6743c403988c7dffd4870a46.webm?t=1770381499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908170/extras/704419bc6743c403988c7dffd4870a46.mp4?t=1770381499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Followed basic instructions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908170/5443768aff92b2dc3e495033413790ddcc27f4f1.jpg"},{"name":"Good at dying","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908170/ea7c005f9e6770b1c6a433047a5a43dc357809eb.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Area 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908170/3959686e2ef8d2e94e2322bb991a20b3949b640c.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Area 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908170/205e26c5d3bcfd8718b726698b27a980ad2293a7.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Area 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908170/8e95c894be849c1f071e27d3aabff6eb1d4e1b1d.jpg"},{"name":"Completed Area 4","path":"https:/